    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 (Level 11) — The Moon</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You can cast <strong>Detect Thoughts</strong> 1/Soma Break without expending a manifestation slot and reroll the lowest die on checks against being charmed.</li>\n<li><strong>Strategic:</strong> —</li>\n</ul><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"moonT3\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Detect Thoughts</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Action &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Cast Detect Thoughts without expending a manifestation slot. (Permanent reroll the lowest die vs. charm is passive.)</div>\n</div>",
